    "notes": {
        "bffdcd1a-8a07-411e-adf6-0592e236f4d0": {
            "x": 64,
            "y": 32,
            "width": 672,
            "height": 224,
            "content": "## ⚠️ Test data assumption\n\nThe flow requests the **first item of the service catalog** (a new Freshservice account ships with sample items such as Office Desktop).\n\n1. The catalog must have at least one item in the primary workspace.\n2. The first item must not have mandatory form fields; otherwise Place Service Request fails with 400. Move an item without mandatory fields to the top, or add one in Admin > Service Catalog.\n\nThe service request ticket is deleted at the end."
        }
